# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Pauli propagation"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi untuk versi terbaru Pauli propagation"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Pertama, buat environment minimal yang hanya berisi Python. Kami menyarankan memakai [Python virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan environment barumu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package – from PyPI or source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Ada dua cara utama untuk menginstal paket ini – dari PyPI atau dari source. Cara yang disarankan adalah menginstal dari PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Instal dari PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Instal dari source {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can install from source if you want to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menginstal dari source kalau ingin mengembangkan di repositori atau menjalankan notebook secara lokal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `pauli-prop` repository.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, clone repositori `pauli-prop`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, instal toolchain Rust, upgrade pip, dan masuk ke repositori. Lihat [dokumentasi Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) untuk petunjuk menginstal toolchain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `pauli-prop` to the virtual environment. Install the notebook dependencies if you want to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, you can install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya adalah menginstal `pauli-prop` ke virtual environment. Instal dependensi notebook kalau kamu ingin menjalankan semua visualisasi di notebook. Kalau kamu berencana mengembangkan di repositori, kamu bisa menginstal dependensi `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Sesuaikan opsi di bawah ini dengan kebutuhanmu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu sudah menginstal dependensi notebook, kamu bisa mulai dengan menjalankan notebook di docs.\n"
